      "description": "The safety brake's own number, for the whole mailbox (send_brake_stats(), which Check Brake trips on): permanent bounces among confirmed sends since the later of 3 days ago and the last cleared bounce-rate pause. The brake trips strictly over 10%. Not filtered by niche.",
